§§ `2. BS02 — Choice of repairer`

-- src:1296 | 2. Mã số BS02/Tasco XCG - Bảo hiểm lựa chọn cơ sở sửa chữa
-- The owner may choose an authorised repairer of the maker or distributor in Vietnam; the cost
-- is accepted only if reasonable. It changes who repairs, not how much is paid: the payment rules
-- already take the reasonable cost (`cost` of each item). No step of the settlement changes.

