-- Terms agreed in writing outside these rules. Their content is not in this document; a loss
-- that such a clause might reach is declined (`BS16 another clause agreed in writing`).
@ref Chapter VI item 16 (src 1538-1543)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the policy carries an additional clause whose terms are not in these rules` MEANS
    REFUSE "the policy carries an additional clause whose terms are not in these rules"

§§ `What the clauses change for an own-damage claim`

GIVEN a     IS A TYPE
      c     IS A BOOLEAN
      xs    IS A LIST OF a
GIVETH A LIST OF a
`only if` c `then` xs MEANS IF c THEN xs ELSE EMPTY

@ref Chapter VI, clauses BS01 to BS15
GIVEN `the policy`        IS A `A policy`
      `the circumstances` IS A `The circumstances`
      `the loss`          IS AN `An own-damage loss`
      `the facts`         IS A `Facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH A `What the additional clauses change`
`Chapter VI — what the clauses change under` `the policy` `in` `the circumstances` `for` `the loss` `, given` `the facts` MEANS
    `What the additional clauses change` WITH
        `general exclusions lifted` IS
            concat (LIST
                (`only if` `BS05 applies` `then` (LIST `10.1 outside Vietnam`)),
                (`only if` (`BS08 applies` OR `BS09 applies` OR `BS15 applies`) `then` (LIST `10.4 no valid inspection certificate`)),
                (`only if` `BS11 applies` `then` (LIST `10.5 driver under age or without a valid licence`)))
        `own-damage exclusions lifted` IS
            concat (LIST
                (`only if` `BS03 applies` `then` (LIST `13.6 engine or electrics in a flooded area`)),
                (`only if` `BS04 applies` `then` (LIST `13.3 theft of a part`)),
                (`only if` (`BS04 applies` AND `the loss`'s `cause` EQUALS `theft or robbery of a part`)
                           `then` (LIST `13.1 outside the cover of Article 11`)),
                (`only if` (`in force` `BS10 added equipment`) `then` (LIST `13.10 added equipment`)),
                (`only if` `BS13 applies` `then` (LIST `13.11 operating special equipment`)))
        `no depreciation on parts or the traction battery` IS `in force` `BS01 new for old`
        `no proportion for under-insurance` IS `BS06 applies`
        `deductibles of the clauses engaged` IS
            concat (LIST
                (`only if` `BS03 applies` `then` (LIST `BS03 — the deductible`)),
                (`only if` `BS04 applies` `then` (LIST `BS04 — the deductible`)),
                (`only if` `BS13 applies` `then` (LIST `BS13 — the deductible`)))
    WHERE
        `the date` MEANS `the circumstances`'s `date of the loss`
        `in force` code MEANS `Article 31 — the clause` code `on` `the policy` `is in force on` `the date`
        `a part was stolen` MEANS any (GIVEN i YIELD i's `stolen`) (`the loss`'s `items`)
        `BS03 applies` MEANS `in force` `BS03 water damage to engine and electrics` AND `the loss`'s `vehicle operating in a flooded area`
        `BS04 applies` MEANS
                `in force` `BS04 theft of parts`
            AND `a part was stolen`
            AND `the facts`'s `part thefts already claimed under this contract` LESS THAN `BS04 — the part thefts allowed under` `the policy`
        `BS05 applies` MEANS
                `in force` `BS05 own damage outside Vietnam`
            AND NOT `the circumstances`'s `in Vietnam`
            AND elem (`the circumstances`'s `country`) (`the policy`'s `countries named for BS05`)
            AND `the facts`'s `licensed to circulate in that country`
            AND `the facts`'s `driver licensed in that country`
            AND NOT (`the loss`'s `cause` EQUALS `theft or robbery of the whole vehicle`)       -- BS05(c)
            AND NOT `a part was stolen`                                                       -- BS05(c)
        `BS06 applies` MEANS
                `in force` `BS06 duty-free or temporarily imported vehicle`
            AND `the facts`'s `temporarily imported for re-export, duty-free, or a diplomatic vehicle`
            AND `the loss`'s `repaired in Vietnam`                                            -- BS06(c)
        `BS08 applies` MEANS
                `in force` `BS08 temporary circulation`
            AND `the facts`'s `new with a factory quality slip, or imported with a quality certificate and customs papers`
            AND `the date` AT MOST (`the start of the clause` `BS08 temporary circulation` `on` `the policy` PLUS 30)
        `BS09 applies` MEANS
                `in force` `BS09 vehicle used only inside a closed site`
            AND `the facts`'s `used only inside a closed site, never on public roads, with chassis and engine numbers`
            AND `the facts`'s `loss inside the closed site`
        `BS11 applies` MEANS
                `in force` `BS11 driving-school vehicle`
            AND `the facts`'s `a qualifying driving-school vehicle driven by a learner in traffic`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `learner not listed, or without card, learner's permit or papers`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `instructor without a practising certificate`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `no learner sign or no auxiliary brake`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `outside the school's permitted time or route`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `no instructor beside the learner, outside a test`
        `BS13 applies` MEANS
                `in force` `BS13 special equipment`
            AND `the loss`'s `during operation of special equipment`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `special vehicle not technically safe`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `operator without the right licence for the special equipment`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `operator deliberately broke the operating instructions`
        `BS15 applies` MEANS
                `in force` `BS15 converted goods vehicle`
            AND `the facts`'s `a converted or modified goods vehicle`
            AND NOT `the facts`'s `inspection certificate expired at the loss`

§§ `The own-damage answer with the clauses`

@ref Chapters II and VI
GIVEN `the policy`         IS A `A policy`
      `the circumstances`  IS A `The circumstances`
      `the conduct`        IS A `The conduct after the loss`
      `the determinations` IS A `Tasco's determinations`
      `the loss`           IS AN `An own-damage loss`
      `the facts`          IS A `Facts for the additional clauses`
GIVETH AN `An own-damage answer`
`the own-damage answer under` `the policy` `in` `the circumstances` `the conduct` `the determinations` `of` `the loss` `with the clauses, given` `the facts` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the answer`
    WHEN `own damage payable` s THEN `the answer`
    WHEN `own damage not covered` r e THEN
        IF   `Article 31 — the clause` `BS16 another clause agreed in writing` `on` `the policy` `is in force on` (`the circumstances`'s `date of the loss`)
        THEN `the policy carries an additional clause whose terms are not in these rules`
        ELSE `the answer`
    WHERE
        `the answer` MEANS
            `Chapter II — the own-damage answer under` `the policy` `in` `the circumstances` `the conduct` `the determinations` `of` `the loss`
                `, given` (`Chapter VI — what the clauses change under` `the policy` `in` `the circumstances` `for` `the loss` `, given` `the facts`)

@ref Chapters IV and VI
GIVEN `the policy`         IS A `A policy`
      `the circumstances`  IS A `The circumstances`
      `the conduct`        IS A `The conduct after the loss`
      `the determinations` IS A `Tasco's determinations`
      `the loss`           IS A `A loss of goods`
GIVETH A `A goods answer`
`the goods answer under` `the policy` `in` `the circumstances` `the conduct` `the determinations` `of` `the loss` `with the clauses` MEANS
    `Chapter IV — the goods answer under` `the policy` `in` `the circumstances` `the conduct` `the determinations` `of` `the loss`
        `, lifting` (`BS14 — what the clause lifts from Article 23 under` `the policy` `for` `the loss` `on` (`the circumstances`'s `date of the loss`))
